  "jei.spinzs_mod.electrium_ingot_info": "The main power source of SpinZ\u0027s Mod. Used in just about every machine and can be purified and liquified to extend usage. Also is used in the components that are used in those machines. Can be collected with an Electrium Collector or by crafting with Electrium Shards found in the Deep Dark biome\nActs as 10 EP (Electrium Power) when put in machines. 10 EP \u003d 100 FE",
  "jei.spinzs_mod.pure_electrium_info": "Pure Electrium is a purified form of normal Electrium Ingots and acts as 50 EP rather than the 10 that Electrium Ingots provide.",
  "jei.spinzs_mod.electrium_cluster_info": "Found underground in the Deep Dark and drops Electrium Shards to make Electrium Ingots and most of the machines in the mod.",
  "jei.spinzs_mod.refractor_info": "Used to induct a large amount of light through things to refract them. Turns Shadium to Refined Shadium and is powered by a Redstone Block on the back and a Glowine Block on top that is consumed on use.\nRefracts only the three blocks in front of it and it\u0027s charring explosion can be prevented by covering the sides and bottom with a high-resistance block like obsidian or Strong Titanium Blocks.",
  "jei.spinzs_mod.shadium_ore_info": "Found in the outer end islands and is made up of actual holes in reality only able to be interacted with due to the endstone dust collecting on it.",
  "jei.spinzs_mod.shadium_fragment_info": "Dropped by Shadium Ore and makes Shadium Ingots when combined with Netherite.",
